  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "포곡쥬 카페...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECACE1C96C0020CE74D398002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 카페는\n조용하고 한적한 게 좋지 않나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020CE74D398B294000AC870C6A9D558ACE00020D55CC801D55C0020AC8C0020C88BC9C00020C54AB098C694003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 카페도 예전에는 손님이 너무 늘어나서\n감당할 수 없을 정도였던 적이 있었어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020CE74D398B3C40020C608C804C5D0B2940020C190B2D8C7740020B108BB340020B298C5B4B098C11C000AAC10B2F9D5600020C2180020C5C6C7440020C815B3C4C600B3580020C801C7740020C788C5C8C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무 바쁘면\n마음에 여유가 없어져서 별로고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB340020BC14C058BA74000AB9C8C74CC5D00020C5ECC720AC000020C5C6C5B4C838C11C0020BCC4B85CACE0002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다고 손님이 없으면 가게가 망하고...\n그 중간을 찾는 게 어렵단 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4ACE00020C190B2D8C7740020C5C6C73CBA740020AC00AC8CAC000020B9DDD558ACE0002E002E002E000AADF80020C911AC04C7440020CC3EB2940020AC8C0020C5B4B835B2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 소린지 아시겠나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C18CB9B0C9C00020C544C2DCACA0B098C694003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전혀 모르겠는데요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804D6000020BAA8B974ACA0B294B370C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전 에스퍼가 아니거든요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8040020C5D0C2A4D37CAC000020C544B2C8AC70B4E0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "간단히 말하자면, 바빠지지 않으면서도\n가게가 망하지 않을 만큼 손님을 모을 만한<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n메뉴 개발을 도와주셨으면 한다는 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 메뉴가 좋을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020BA54B274AC000020C88BC744AE4CC694003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르갈레트",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974AC08B808D2B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크루아상",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CB8E8C544C0C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카레라이스",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B808B77CC774C2A40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르갈레트는 어디에 내놓아도\n미르갈레트라서 별로인 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B2940020C5B4B514C5D00020B0B4B193C544B3C4000ABBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B77CC11C0020BCC4B85CC7780020AC830020AC19C544C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크루아상으로는 누보 카페를\n이길 수 없어서 별로인 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CB8E8C544C0C1C73CB85CB2940020B204BCF40020CE74D398B97C000AC774AE380020C2180020C5C6C5B4C11C0020BCC4B85CC7780020AC830020AC19C544C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카레라이스는 호텔Z의 카레가\n은근히 맛있어서 비교당할 것 같아 별로예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B808B77CC774C2A4B2940020D638D154005AC7580020CE74B808AC00000AC740ADFCD7880020B9DBC788C5B4C11C0020BE44AD50B2F9D5600020AC830020AC19C5440020BCC4B85CC608C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...초밥은 어떨까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002ECD08BC25C7400020C5B4B5A8AE4CC694003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "간단한 식사로 먹을 수 있으면서\n커피와는 어울리지 않는...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n손님이 그럭저럭 모일 만한 메뉴잖아요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC04B2E8D55C0020C2DDC0ACB85C0020BA39C7440020C2180020C788C73CBA74C11C000ACEE4D53CC640B2940020C5B4C6B8B9ACC9C00020C54AB294002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC190B2D8C7740020ADF8B7EDC800B7ED0020BAA8C77C0020B9CCD55C0020BA54B274C796C544C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 생각한 거지만\n좋은 아이디어 같아요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C0DDAC01D55C0020AC70C9C0B9CC000AC88BC7400020C544C774B514C5B40020AC19C544C694002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문제는 제가\n초밥을 만들어 본 적이 없단 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C81CB2940020C81CAC00000ACD08BC25C7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF80020C801C7740020C5C6B2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "롤링 드리머에 가서 먹어 보는 건\n돈이 드니까 별로인 것 같고...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 소린지 아시겠나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B864B9C10020B4DCB9ACBA38C5D00020AC00C11C0020BA39C5B40020BCF4B2940020AC74000AB3C8C7740020B4DCB2C8AE4C0020BCC4B85CC7780020AC830020AC19ACE0002E002E002E00100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020C18CB9B0C9C00020C544C2DCACA0B098C694003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모르시는 것 같으니 설명해 드리자면,\n싸리용을 보여 달라는 거예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n3종류의 모습 전부요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B974C2DCB2940020AC830020AC19C73CB2C80020C124BA85D5740020B4DCB9ACC790BA74002C000AC2F8B9ACC6A9C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B2ECB77CB2940020AC70C608C694002E00100001BE00000A0033C885B958C7580020BAA8C2B50020C804BD80C694002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸리용의 모습은 3종류...\n어느 모습을 보여 주실 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
