      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8B9ACC6A9C7580020BAA8C2B500200033C885B958B97C000ABAA8B4500020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "적당히 초밥을 만들어 볼 테니\n기다려 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C801B2F9D7880020CD08BC25C7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCFC0020D14CB2C8000AAE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠세요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아마추어가 만든 티가 팍팍 나지만\n궁금해서 주문해 보고 싶은...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0C138C694003F00100001BE01000AC544B9C8CD94C5B4AC000020B9CCB4E00020D2F0AC000020D30DD30D0020B098C9C0B9CC000AAD81AE08D574C11C0020C8FCBB38D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C740002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다시 말해, 적당히 팔리지만\n바빠지지는 않는 메뉴가 완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C2DC0020B9D0D574002C0020C801B2F9D7880020D314B9ACC9C0B9CC000ABC14BE60C9C0C9C0B2940020C54AB2940020BA54B274AC000020C644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진심인가?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4C2ECC778AC00003F00100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "초밥에 커피!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD08BC25C5D00020CEE4D53C0021003F00100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 미르시티는\n미식의 도시라니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B294000ABBF8C2DDC7580020B3C4C2DCB77CB2C8AE4C002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹어 보진 않았지만...\n이건 세상에 널리 알려야만 해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C5B40020BCF4C9C40020C54AC558C9C0B9CC002E002E002E000AC774AC740020C138C0C1C5D00020B110B9AC0020C54CB824C57CB9CC0020D574002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여러분, 조아예요!\n제가 미르에서 굉장한 걸 발견한 거 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECB7ECBD84002C0020C870C544C608C6940021000AC81CAC000020BBF8B974C5D0C11C0020AD49C7A5D55C0020AC780020BC1CACACD55C0020AC700020C788C8E0002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여러분도 포곡쥬 카페에서\n초밥&커피라는 새로운 세계를 만나 보세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECB7ECBD84B3C40020D3ECACE1C96C0020CE74D398C5D0C11C000ACD08BC250026CEE4D53CB77CB2940020C0C8B85CC6B40020C138ACC4B97C0020B9CCB0980020BCF4C138C694002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 참... 또 즉흥적으로\n세상에 영향을 미치고 말았네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40020CC38002E002E002E0020B6100020C989D765C801C73CB85C000AC138C0C1C5D00020C601D5A5C7440020BBF8CE58ACE00020B9D0C558B124002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기야 여기!\n초밥&커피로 유명한 가게래!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C57C0020C5ECAE300021000ACD08BC250026CEE4D53CB85C0020C720BA85D55C0020AC00AC8CB79800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "초밥&커피 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD08BC250026CEE4D53C0020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "초밥&커피!\n초커 하나 플리~즈!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD08BC250026CEE4D53C0021000ACD08CEE40020D558B0980020D50CB9AC007EC98800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으앙~!\n바쁜 건 정말 별로야!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
